{"posts":[{"id":"diamond_p7_151","t":"Hello guys, My 10 first diamonds","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#151","p":7,"im":[],"m":151},{"id":"diamond_p7_152","t":"Can someone please delete last post, + this one? Thank you","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#152","p":7,"im":[],"m":152},{"id":"diamond_p7_153","t":"","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#153","p":7,"im":["7f27d4a20920ce1859156c45e2f0e5e22820608b","078a62bb21d2a426d9c630c7c8b8da6bdcebaf4e","e17fbeed2620621eee7421d1ec3bbba307ebd6d3","81c14e513dc17ebb743c1483d4885714f6578bf4"],"m":153},{"id":"diamond_p7_154","t":"Funny to see how QMs and DMs can work together and tell the same story","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#154","p":7,"im":["3a34d53466dd9fdbd474f40f96c1a3f4cc071d24"],"m":154},{"id":"diamond_p7_155","t":"1) I noticed that the Diamond Level is actually placed at the 1st High (Low) by many people in the forums whereas I was placing mine at the second. This is corrected in my second chart.\n\n2) I realized after finding those 2 diamonds that they were already posted by members before me. Well at least I won't need much correction","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#155","p":7,"im":["32ba69a0641631f7d6119c1c6f925d5457b60345","3eba48bbaf6dafac02c8045c9fd47a0f3411a907"],"m":155},{"id":"diamond_p7_156","t":"","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#156","p":7,"im":["3489f37a52146a9932275ddfbc2b1931cad0fc42","ba06d3d2da5973883d3713ef1e8f03b764cd46ab","22575822e0a49a29645e56753eb2de320c4f8b04","355f8278f5c8f3a32a832f4ebaf94cd87c4edb13","c756314319c62123d2068b84e9fdc3d246f8dfd7"],"m":156},{"id":"diamond_p7_157","t":"great job greywind:)","a":"Duds","d":"","n":"#157","p":7,"im":[],"m":157},{"id":"diamond_p7_158","t":"Starting on my diamonds! homework is great stuff","a":"Duds","d":"","n":"#158","p":7,"im":["bce79b4ac43e587c16b9d08488338972964ed1bc","358e9eefbe194bbdf75447a3e7332e69a8e59d0c"],"m":158},{"id":"diamond_p7_159","t":"Hi Duds and thanks\n\nYour first chart is not a diamond because you don't have a LLL before hitting the DM level. You have a QM though, taking your \"x\" point as the first high of the QM.\n\nSecond chart: Shine On You Crazy Diamond","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#159","p":7,"im":[],"m":159},{"id":"diamond_p7_160","t":"Studying this next diamond has been very informative to me. I've learnt that when you want to get onboard a trade, you will try to find reasons to justify your trade and convince yourself this is a good one, even if those reasons are totally made up.\n\nI opened my chart and saw this DM setup. Problem is: it wasn't at an important level. So I went left and looked for a level. Couldn't find one. At this point if you trade live and you're a bad trader, you'll get frustrated because you finally found a QM (or a DM) but can't find which level it corresponds to. So you create it. You go find a meaningless FL that has been broken twice in the past and use this as your level. You trade the QM: it fails. But it's ok you say, the QM failed because the real move is a DM! And you will take the DM. What next? If the DM fails, I'll say \"oh, it's because it was part of a bigger Gartley\", which itself is part of a bigger QM?\n\nThis shows the importance of reading the market; seeing is not reading.","a":"greywind5","d":"","n":"#160","p":7,"im":["3038616c1140201474c07a6685bf7e89ff1b005b"],"m":160},{"id":"diamond_p7_161","t":"Okay so I am confused.. To me that looks like a perfect diamond that dropped to its base. I have gone through the diamond info but I haven't found anything stating that you had to have a HHH and a LLL. Of course one of those would have to happen but are having both a requirement?","a":"Duds","d":"","n":"#161","p":7,"im":[],"m":161},{"id":"diamond_p7_162","t":"Hi guys!! is this a Diamond?? How do I know the direction?? thank you!!!","a":"full","d":"","n":"#162","p":7,"im":["dfee2a1660bfd5c6f714e4d29169ec6de255608c"],"m":162},{"id":"diamond_p7_163","t":"Away\n\nMy 1st diamond","a":"lv5758","d":"","n":"#163","p":7,"im":["98493eeb5adddb163e5411a8c8e0c9e0d172ab08"],"m":16